He was chosen by the four-leaf clover.

264
00:16:19,880 --> 00:16:32,880
What's going on there? Even if he doesn't have any significant talent, he should still be able to float.

265
00:16:32,880 --> 00:16:37,880
If you'll excuse me for a moment.

266
00:16:37,880 --> 00:16:40,880
Can you believe this guy?

267
00:16:40,880 --> 00:16:42,880
Well, that's one down at least.

268
00:16:42,880 --> 00:16:45,880
Why did he even bother to come?

269
00:16:45,880 --> 00:16:48,880
Hey, what are you doing? This is supposed to be the easy part.

270
00:16:48,880 --> 00:16:53,880
Try relaxing your muscles a bit. See? It really couldn't be simpler.

271
00:16:53,880 --> 00:16:55,880
Wow! Man, that's so awesome!

272
00:16:55,880 --> 00:16:57,880
Don't tense up. Let it come naturally.

273
00:16:57,880 --> 00:17:00,880
Right! Got it! You're a good guy, you know?

274
00:17:00,880 --> 00:17:04,880
Nope! Still not happening!

275
00:17:04,880 --> 00:17:11,880
Right.

276
00:17:11,880 --> 00:17:13,880
What are you doing?

277
00:17:13,880 --> 00:17:15,880
I just… I mean…

278
00:17:15,880 --> 00:17:21,880
Don't play dumb with me. I've told you royalty need not undergo the same tests as common folk.

279
00:17:21,880 --> 00:17:22,880
Yes, but…

280
00:17:22,880 --> 00:17:28,880
Enough. Where you'll go is already decided. Stop this pointless nonsense.

281
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:30,880
Yes. Of course, Nozel.

282
00:17:30,880 --> 00:17:35,880
Although, if we're being honest, your very existence is pointless.

283
00:17:46,880 --> 00:17:49,880
It's fine! Try to relax!

284
00:17:53,880 --> 00:17:55,880
Shake it off and keep going!

285
00:17:55,880 --> 00:17:59,880
I'm not done yet!

286
00:17:59,880 --> 00:18:01,880
Well, what's next?

287
00:18:04,880 --> 00:18:07,880
Nope! Still not giving up!

288
00:18:13,880 --> 00:18:18,880
On to the next test. The final and most difficult. A display of combat skill.

289
00:18:18,880 --> 00:18:22,880
Prepare to duel!

290
00:18:22,880 --> 00:18:28,880
You will break into pairs and fight each other! Use your grimoires to attack and defend!

291
00:18:28,880 --> 00:18:34,880
I bet losing will tank your chances of being chosen. Better to choose an easy partner. Someone weak.

292
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:39,880
As knights, battle is our business. We want to see everything you're capable of!

293
00:18:39,880 --> 00:18:48,880
The test will end when one combatant either surrenders or is unable to continue. We have mages wielding recovery magic standing by for the injured.

294
00:18:48,880 --> 00:18:50,880
So don't hold anything back!

295
00:18:51,880 --> 00:19:00,880
The last test? I've done nothing but shout this whole time! The best way to show off now is to pair off with someone strong! There's gotta be someone who'll agree to fight me!

296
00:19:00,880 --> 00:19:05,880
Ha ha! What do you say you and I pair up?

297
00:19:05,880 --> 00:19:10,880
You really mean it, Seke? You're willing to take on a charity case like me?

298
00:19:10,880 --> 00:19:12,880
Oh, absolutely! Ha ha!

299
00:19:12,880 --> 00:19:14,880
You really are a good guy!

300
00:19:15,880 --> 00:19:17,880
We're ready for the first bout. Let's go!

301
00:19:17,880 --> 00:19:18,880
We're coming!

302
00:19:19,880 --> 00:19:20,880
Ha ha!

303
00:19:20,880 --> 00:19:30,880
We're both working for the same goal! So we'll have a fair fight but nobody pulls any punches, okay?

304
00:19:31,880 --> 00:19:34,880
Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha!

305
00:19:34,880 --> 00:19:41,880
Stop trying so hard. It's almost getting painful to watch. You're just a grubby little gutter rat who's way out of his depth.

306
00:19:41,880 --> 00:19:48,880
I guess I should thank you for sticking around and making me look good. Once I'm chosen by a squad, I plan to kick up my heels and enjoy the ride.

307
00:19:48,880 --> 00:19:50,880
It's going to be so much fun.

308
00:19:50,880 --> 00:19:53,880
No. Let's get this over with, shall we?

309
00:19:54,880 --> 00:20:01,880
Then you can scurry on home to the garbage heap you came from and get back to whatever pitiful excuse for a life you have left.

310
00:20:01,880 --> 00:20:02,880
Ha ha!

311
00:20:05,880 --> 00:20:09,880
Man, he had the right idea. Picking the weakest partner to duel.

312
00:20:09,880 --> 00:20:10,880
Oh, Seke.

313
00:20:11,880 --> 00:20:13,880
Now! Beacon!

314
00:20:13,880 --> 00:20:17,880
No pulling punches, remember? Let's do this, Asta!

315
00:20:17,880 --> 00:20:18,880
Ha ha!

316
00:20:25,880 --> 00:20:29,880
Bronze Creation Magic! Seke Magnum Cannonball!

317
00:20:30,880 --> 00:20:32,880
What do you think of this, Captains?

318
00:20:32,880 --> 00:20:35,880
The bronze magic power I've crafted is dual purpose.

319
00:20:35,880 --> 00:20:38,880
It protects me and attacks with magic bullets.

320
00:20:38,880 --> 00:20:42,880
It will fend off his pathetic attacks, showing off my skills at defense.

321
00:20:42,880 --> 00:20:46,880
Then, the second he's exhausted, I'll go on the offensive and shoot!

322
00:20:47,880 --> 00:20:50,880
That seems like some fairly high level magic for an examinee.

323
00:20:50,880 --> 00:20:53,880
He looks like an insect though. Big spiny pill bug.

324
00:20:54,880 --> 00:20:57,880
Come on, don't get shy on me now. Ha ha!

325
00:20:57,880 --> 00:21:01,880
Good. Watching him struggle should liven things up.

326
00:21:02,880 --> 00:21:04,880
Okay. Here we go.

327
00:21:04,880 --> 00:21:05,880
Here we go.

328
00:21:13,880 --> 00:21:14,880
Ah!

329
00:21:14,880 --> 00:21:15,880
Ah!

