Ah!

334
00:21:24,880 --> 00:21:25,880
Ah!

335
00:21:28,880 --> 00:21:29,880
Unlike you, Seke.

336
00:21:30,880 --> 00:21:33,880
I'm not joining the magic knights just so I can slack off and have a little fun!

337
00:21:34,880 --> 00:21:36,880
I've got a much bigger goal!

338
00:21:36,880 --> 00:21:38,880
I'm gonna be the Wizard King!

339
00:21:38,880 --> 00:21:41,880
My sweetheart, I'm gonna be the Paper King!

